  "summary": "preinstall lifecycle hook beacons to webhook.site on install",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that fires an outbound request to a webhook.site endpoint whenever the package is installed. webhook.site is a public request-capture service commonly used by attackers as a low-effort C2/data-collection sink. The beacon runs automatically on `npm install` without user interaction, and the endpoint is external, third-party, and attacker-controllable (whoever owns the webhook.site token receives the callback with whatever installer data the hook chooses to send).",
